[Music]  it's been decades since the original  knight rider was on the air and without  kit david hasselhoff and most of the  actors who played friends and foes have  moved on with their lives  let's see where their careers have taken  them the end of the original night rider  series didn't end david hasselhoff's  time on television  after fighting injustice with kit  hasselhoff got the leading role of  lifeguard mitch buchanan on baywatch  which ran for an impressive 11 years  along with numerous film and tv projects  he reprised the role of michael knight  in the 1991 tv movie knight rider 2000  returned to his brief role as snapper  foster and the young and the restless  and played marvel super spy nick fury in  the 1998 tv movie nick fury agent of  shield  in the 21st century hasselhoff's acting  work became increasingly  self-referential with hasselhoff often  appearing  as himself in otherwise fictitious tv  shows and films  easier for you to say he appeared as  himself in episodes of the west wing and  just shoot me he does it on the big  screen too  hasselhoff played himself in piranha 3d  the 2011 comedy hop the 2004 spongebob  squarepants movie and briefly as the  villain ego and guardians of the galaxy  vol 2.  furthermore in 2017 hasselhoff starred  in the action comedy killing hasselhoff  when he's not busy acting hasselhoff  also moonlights as a recording artist  in 2019 he released his 14th album open  your eyes  you won't remember william daniels in  fist fights with bad guys on knight  rider but that's because he filled a  much more important role daniels was the  voice of the smart car kit for all of  the original knight rider series  as well as the 1991 tv movie knight  rider 2000.  before during and after the original run  of knight rider daniels was playing the  role for which he's most fondly  remembered as dr mark craig on the  medical drama saint elsewhere  along with plenty of recurring and  one-off tv and film roles in the  intervening years  the annuals would find a new generation  of fans as cory matthews teacher in the  long-running sitcom boy meets world  he would later reprise the role for the  spin-off series girl meets world  however daniels never completely left  knight rider snarky trance and behind  he voiced kit for two episodes of the  simpsons the lego dimensions video game  and the 2006 comedy the bench warmers  he wasn't often on the action side of  things but knight rider wouldn't have  been the same without edward mulhere  as flaghead devin miles it's devin who  arranges for michael long to be brought  into flag and remade as michael knight  miles and knight don't like each other  very much in the beginning of knight  rider but as the series continues it's  clear the older englishman develops  paternal feelings toward the hero  mulhere's acting career predates knight  rider by about 40 years  among his more memorable classic roles  was captain costanza in the 1965 world  war ii adventure flick von ryan's  express  unfortunately mulhere passed away in  1997 from lung cancer  between the end of knight rider and his  death mulhere played devin miles one  more time in the 1991 tv movie knight  rider 2000.  his final film a comedy called out to  sea came out the year of his passing  rebecca holden played april curtis  kitt's mechanic and flag's lead designer  during knight rider's second season  she took on kind of a motherly role to  the smart car praising kit when the car  performed as it should  and scolding it when it malfunctioned  holden's last appearance was in season  two's penultimate episode let it be me  although april curtis wasn't heard from  again rebecca holden kept her acting  career going  in the late 80s she had one-off spots on  shows like remington steel  night court and a three-episode  recurring role on general hospital in  1987.  her acting since then has been sporadic  but she's still working today in tv and  films  like former co-star david hasselhoff  holden has entertainment aspirations  beyond acting  she started touring with a country band  in 1986 and continued performing and  recording music into the 2010s  with her videos appearing on tnn and cmt  it isn't until knight rider's fourth and  final season that reginald cornelius iii  aka rc3 becomes part of flag's team  played by peter peros  rc3 starts off as a chicago vigilante  scaring off crooks with a fake assault  rifle  after michael knight and kit team up  with rc3 to take down some bank robbers  he's recruited into flag as both a  mechanic and  occasionally night sidekick unlike some  other night rider alumni peros has  enjoyed a lot of regular tv work since  the end of the series  from 1989 to 1991 he was one of the two  leads for the police procedural drama  the new atom12  he also played dr ben harris for 12  years on the soap opera as the world  turns more recently pero stars as  wealthy judge david harrington and tyler  perry's hit soap opera the haves and  have-nots  as you probably already know kilmer had  nothing to do with the 80s version of  knight rider but in the 2008  knight rider tv movie and the subsequent  short lived series it was val kilmer  playing the voice of the artificially  intelligent car kit  after the knight rider remake shuttered  kilmer enjoyed regular work and film and  tv  he plays a vengeful ghost in the 2010  horror the traveler  a fictionalized version of himself in  2012's the fourth dimension  and an officer in the 2017 psychological  crime drama the snowman  kilmer had fans worried in 2015 and 2016  when he abruptly dropped off the radar  for two years kilmer largely denied  rumors that he was battling cancer  in 2017 he opened up about his health  issues with the hollywood reporter  kilmer told thr that he was struggling  with throat cancer he also had a  procedure done on his trachea that made  his voice sound raspy while rendering  him out of breath  thankfully kilmer still seems eager to  work among other upcoming projects he'll  be reprising the role of hotshot pilot  iceman and top gun maverick  if knight rider's kit had a nemesis it  was carr which stood for knight's  automated  roving robot car was the prototype for  what would later become  kits but cars programming cared less  about protecting human life and more  about doing whatever it could to protect  itself  do you wish to drive or shall i  go ahead  the rival vehicle first appears in  season one's trust doesn't rust and is  brought back in season three for the  episode titled kit vs car  while paul pries voiced carr for the  latter appearance it's peter cullen  providing the ruthless car's electronic  voice in season one  he reprised the role for an episode in  the short-lived 2008-2009 knight rider  series  cullen is kept very busy since his short  stints on knight rider  any transformer fans should know his  name cullen has been the voice of  autobot head honcho optimus prime for  decades from the 80s saturday morning  cartoons to michael bay's live-action  films  but cullen's work hardly begins or ends  with transformers  he's done voices for the smurfs teenage  mutant ninja turtles and he was even the  voice of the merciless alien hunter in  1987's predator  and of course who could forget kit not  just the actors who provided his voice  but the car itself  whatever happened to night industries  2000 well as you probably guessed knight  rider needed more than one car to bring  the action and drama to life  in 2017 newsweek looked into what  happened to the different kits from the  series and discovered that there had  been between 14 and 16 different pontiac  trans ams owned by the  studio most of the vehicles were  acquired through a stroke of luck  in 1983 a train transporting pontiac  trans ams derailed  while none of the cars were damaged  california state law deemed none of the  cars could be sold to drivers  general motors sold the cars instead to  knight rider for a dollar apiece with  the stipulation that they would all need  to be destroyed once the show was done  with them  after the series ended the studio rented  a crane and smashed all but five of the  cars with a wrecking ball  a couple of night rider superfans  tracked down the surviving five kits  one is somewhere in the uk while two  were located museums in indiana and  miami the knight riders superfans bought  the remaining two  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite actors are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

